// (15) Local revocation during partition while recovery host attempts restore before execution record arrives
Scenario adv-fifteen-partition-local-revocation-quarantine-fencing
  From ADV.1 "(15) a revocation executed locally during a partition while a connected recovery host attempts a restore before the record of execution arrives"
{
